<body>
    <main class="goal-shell site-shell">
        <header class="goal-header site-hanging-nav"><a class="brand" href="/main"><span>G</span> GUCCANG</a><a class="manage-link" href="/goal/manage">详细管理</a></header>
        <section class="goal-hero site-page-hero"><div class="site-page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow site-kicker">GOAL MAP</p><h1 class="site-page-title">看清方向，然后完成下一步。</h1><p class="site-page-description">四层目标在同一张地图上；细节和复盘留在详细管理中。</p></div><div class="site-page-hero__exhibit"><span class="site-page-symbol" data-symbol="goal" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="today-mark"><span>今天</span><strong id="todayLabel">—</strong></div></div></section>
